ENTRY_BEGIN
MATCH opcode qtype qname serial=1
REPLY QUERY NOERROR
ADJUST copy_id
SECTION QUESTION
example.com. IN IXFR
SECTION ANSWER
example.com. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.com. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 1 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.com. 3600 AMTRELAY 10 0 3 relay.example.
example.com. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.com. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
ENTRY_END

ENTRY_BEGIN
MATCH opcode qtype qname serial=1
REPLY QUERY NOERROR
ADJUST copy_id
SECTION QUESTION
example.net. IN IXFR
SECTION ANSWER
example.net. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.net. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 1 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.net. 3600 IPSECKEY 10 3 2 gateway.example. AAAA
example.net. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
example.net. 3600 IN SOA ns0.example.org. root 2 3600 28800 2419200 3600
ENTRY_END

